    "updated_at": "2020-05-19T22:15:49Z",
    "body": "Hey everyone. Quick update, this gets resolved in the format strings rework that is ongoing right now in which prefix/suffix is removed completely. Most modules will have an entry called `format` that configures the display format of the module.\r\n\r\nThe documentation that @pbnj pointed to is not ideal. It can be updated to be clearer that not all the modules support the customization of the prefixes and suffixes. If someone would like to contribute that, feel free :).\r\n\r\nYou can follow the work going on for the release/contribute in this umbrella issue: #1057.",
