    "body": "Just so it's clear to everybody as it wasn't to me. While there has been a HUGE amount of work on this issue, the fix has not yet been released. The above issue linked by @sirMerr has also been closed but the **v0.45.0** release appears to be still waiting on the following:\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/milestone/3\r\nWhich (currently) only has one open ticket left:\r\nhttps://github.com/starship/starship/issues/1404\r\n\r\nps. thank you to everybody who worked on this.",
