    "created_at": "2020-09-19T10:18:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-19T10:18:58Z",
    "body": "Hi @ev-dev, I've actually just been cleaning up the issues to try to get a clear picture of what is left for the [v0.45.0 release](https://github.com/starship/starship/milestone/3) and I think at this point it looks like the only things left are a slight regression in one of the modules and a migration guide. Unfortunately this release has taken a lot longer than I think any of us had hoped but I think we are getting close to the finish line now. With that in mind what I'm going to do now is to close this issue so that we can see what is left in before we do the [v0.45.0 release](https://github.com/starship/starship/milestone/3). If anyone wants to help get this release across the line please try running the current master locally to see if you can find any other regressions, review any open PRs and if you know some rust help close the last few issues.",
